<title>USA: Universal Fuels to buy Camden-Townwest.</title>
<headline>Universal Fuels to buy Camden-Townwest.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Universal Fuels Co said Tuesday it has signed a definitive agreement to acquire privately held Camden-Townwest Inc, a Dallas-based real estate investment trust.</p>
<p>Universal said it will acquire Camden-Townwest for an undisclosed amount of Universal's common stock.</p>
